{
  "declaredLength": 6760,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Meh. Esta Luminalia Dimensional tampoco\nes que sea nada del otro jueves.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estoy de acuerdo. No son más que edificios\ncorrientes como los de nuestro mundo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Don Córax!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10044006F006E0020004300F3007200610078002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Don Córax!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10044006F006E0020004300F3007200610078002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Qué quieres?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100BF0051007500E900200071007500690065007200650073003F002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aún no he tenido la ocasión de darle las gracias\npor aquella propina que me dio. Me vino de<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nperlas para cancelar mi deuda.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aún no he tenido la ocasión de darle las gracias\npor aquella propina que me entregó. Me sirvió<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npara cancelar mi deuda.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quien empeña su dinero se empeña a sí mismo.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNo me pareció bien que no estuviéramos en\nigualdad de condiciones. Por eso lo hice, ya está.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 145
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero, ya que estáis aquí, decidme: ¿os apetece\nun combate contra nosotros dos?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Yo encantado! ¿Qué me dices, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10059006F00200065006E00630061006E007400610064006F0021002000BF0051007500E90020006D0065002000640069006300650073002C00200010000201000000003F00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Yo encantada! ¿Qué te parece, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10059006F00200065006E00630061006E00740061006400610021002000BF0051007500E90020007400650020007000610072006500630065002C00200010000201000000003F00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Claro!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006C00610072006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No sé yo...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0020007300E900200079006F002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Venga, no conviene hacer esperar a don Córax.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560065006E00670061002C0020006E006F00200063006F006E007600690065006E0065002000680061006300650072002000650073007000650072006100720020006100200064006F006E0020004300F3007200610078002E00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No me hace mucha gracia esto de hacer esperar\na don Córax, qué quieres que te diga.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estás con el líder del Equipo MZ. ¡Es imposible\nque perdamos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007400E1007300200063006F006E00200065006C0020006C00ED006400650072002000640065006C002000450071007500690070006F0020004D005A002E002000A10045007300200069006D0070006F007300690062006C0065000A007100750065002000700065007200640061006D006F0073002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estás con la líder del Equipo MZ. ¡Es imposible\nque perdamos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007400E1007300200063006F006E0020006C00610020006C00ED006400650072002000640065006C002000450071007500690070006F0020004D005A002E002000A10045007300200069006D0070006F007300690062006C0065000A007100750065002000700065007200640061006D006F0073002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quiero estar a la altura de mi Scolipede.\nVenga, ¿combatimos o qué?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00510075006900650072006F002000650073007400610072002000610020006C006100200061006C00740075007200610020006400650020006D0069002000530063006F006C00690070006500640065002E000A00560065006E00670061002C002000BF0063006F006D0062006100740069006D006F00730020006F00200071007500E9003F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quiero demostrarle de nuevo a don Córax que\npuede confiar en mí.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00510075006900650072006F002000640065006D006F00730074007200610072006C00650020006400650020006E007500650076006F0020006100200064006F006E0020004300F30072006100780020007100750065000A0070007500650064006500200063006F006E006600690061007200200065006E0020006D00ED002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Combatamos!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F006D0062006100740061006D006F007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espera un poco",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006100200075006E00200070006F0063006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Venga ya! ¡Que mi tiempo es oro!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560065006E006700610020007900610021002000A10051007500650020006D00690020007400690065006D0070006F0020006500730020006F0072006F002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Esta vez no tendré piedad!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10045007300740061002000760065007A0020006E006F002000740065006E0064007200E90020007000690065006400610064002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Esperaré lo que haga falta. Tengo nervios de\nacero.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730070006500720061007200E90020006C006F002000710075006500200068006100670061002000660061006C00740061002E002000540065006E0067006F0020006E0065007200760069006F0073002000640065000A0061006300650072006F002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No te lo pondré fácil. Dejarme vencer arrastraría\npor el fango la reputación de don Córax.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don Córax y Giso están esperando.\n¡Vamos a combatir de una vez!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F006E0020004300F3007200610078002000790020004700690073006F002000650073007400E1006E0020006500730070006500720061006E0064006F002E000A00A100560061006D006F00730020006100200063006F006D0062006100740069007200200064006500200075006E0061002000760065007A002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don Córax y Giso están esperando.\n¡Vamos a combatir de una vez!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F006E0020004300F3007200610078002000790020004700690073006F002000650073007400E1006E0020006500730070006500720061006E0064006F002E000A00A100560061006D006F00730020006100200063006F006D0062006100740069007200200064006500200075006E0061002000760065007A002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Scolipede! ¡Contigo a mi lado puedo seguir\nsonriendo aunque esté entre la espada y la pared!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La megaevolución refleja el lazo que nos une...\n¡Admirad la verdadera belleza de mi Skarmory!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Combatir junto a ti me anima a superar mis\nlímites!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F006D006200610074006900720020006A0075006E0074006F002000610020007400690020006D006500200061006E0069006D006100200061002000730075007000650072006100720020006D00690073000A006C00ED006D0069007400650073002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Combatir junto a ti me anima a superar mis\nlímites!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F006D006200610074006900720020006A0075006E0074006F002000610020007400690020006D006500200061006E0069006D006100200061002000730075007000650072006100720020006D00690073000A006C00ED006D0069007400650073002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡El combate contra don Córax y Giso ha sido\nlo más!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10045006C00200063006F006D006200610074006500200063006F006E00740072006100200064006F006E0020004300F3007200610078002000790020004700690073006F0020006800610020007300690064006F000A006C006F0020006D00E10073002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡El combate contra don Córax y Giso ha sido\nlo más!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10045006C00200063006F006D006200610074006500200063006F006E00740072006100200064006F006E0020004300F3007200610078002000790020004700690073006F0020006800610020007300690064006F000A006C006F0020006D00E10073002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por algo fuisteis los mejores en los Juegos Z-A.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nY nosotros aún tenemos que aprender a\ncompenetrarnos mejor.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 116
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hemos perdido a causa de mi incompetencia.\nLo siento mucho, don Córax.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tonterías, Giso. Lo has hecho a pedir de boca\ny te estoy tan agradecido como siempre.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y ahora vamos a finiquitar esto, que no hay\nmanera de perderos de vista ni aunque me vaya<U+0010><U+0001>븀\na otra dimensión, literalmente.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 129
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Toma esto. Aunque te pido un favor a cambio.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F006D00610020006500730074006F002E002000410075006E0071007500650020007400650020007000690064006F00200075006E0020006600610076006F007200200061002000630061006D00620069006F002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Has recibido el Traje de Córax.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480061007300200072006500630069006200690064006F00200065006C0020005400720061006A00650020006400650020004300F3007200610078002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "De un tiempo a esta parte, nuestros dos grupos\nse han acercado de cara a la opinión pública.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero no os equivoquéis. Todo el mundo sabe\nque con el Clan Corrosión no se juega.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNosotros no dudamos en hundir en el agua al\nMagikarp que osa saltar fuera o en arrancarle<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nla piel al Ekans que intenta mudarla.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 220
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tenemos una reputación que mantener.\nAsí que ojo con lo que hacéis y decís por ahí.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ciudad Luminalia me acogió y me hizo quien soy.\nSe lo debo todo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006900750064006100640020004C0075006D0069006E0061006C006900610020006D0065002000610063006F0067006900F3002000790020006D0065002000680069007A006F00200071007500690065006E00200073006F0079002E000A005300650020006C006F0020006400650062006F00200074006F0064006F002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Que no me entere yo de que vas asustando a\nla gente haciéndote pasar por el jefe.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Los combates Pokémon son geniales!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
